oveAll cleanup: … directory not empty` cleanup race.\n- `TaskOnTheRunEngine` — presses a part row and expects the store root's `plandb done` trajectory line; a run is now its own row with its parts under it and each row opens that task's page (entry `1231-task-page-and-rail-door`). Both reruns opened a populated child-task page (`write HELLO.md containing the word hello · done · 1m55s · 1 file · branch kept`), not an empty room.\n\nThe other four new reds are real regressions and are filed separately (in-window firing not drawn, Home `Up` cannot select a waiting exchange, hover preview blank, `/spend` vs Settings → Spending disagree after an interrupt).","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Agent-Field/CodeAF/issues/comments/5768785128/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"AbirAbbas","id":34643372,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0NjQzMzcy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34643372?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AbirAbbas","html_url":"https://github.com/AbirAbbas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AbirAbbas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AbirAbbas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AbirAbbas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AbirAbbas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AbirAbbas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AbirAbbas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AbirAbbas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AbirAbbas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AbirAbbas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":31697924322,"node_id":"LE_lADOTu5AHM8AAAABR-s3dc8AAAAHYVfw4g","ur